<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4da608e elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-element_type="widget" data-id="4da608e" data-widget_type="heading.default">
<div class="elementor-widget-container">
<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">About CURE FOUNDATION</h2> </div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-6c88cde elementor-section-content-middle elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default" data-element_type="section" data-id="6c88cde">
<div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-extended">
<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-a4b42e7" data-element_type="column" data-id="a4b42e7">
<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-a6e9127 elementor-widget elementor-widget-video" data-element_type="widget" data-id="a6e9127" data-settings='{"video_type":"hosted","controls":"yes"}' data-widget_type="video.default">
<div class="elementor-widget-container">
<div class="e-hosted-video elementor-wrapper elementor-open-inline">
<video class="elementor-video" controls="" controlslist="nodownload" preload="metadata" src="/assets/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/WhatsApp-Video-2025-10-14-at-4.01.06-PM.mp4"></video>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-7e3cf56" data-element_type="column" data-id="7e3cf56">
<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-00dab00 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-element_type="widget" data-id="00dab00" data-widget_type="heading.default">
<div class="elementor-widget-container">
<div class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">ABOUT CURE FOUNDATION</div> </div>
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-53dbc6d elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-element_type="widget" data-id="53dbc6d" data-widget_type="heading.default">
<div class="elementor-widget-container">
<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">CURE foundation is a non-profit organization dedicated to helping people manage cancer

</h2> </div>
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2323ccc elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-element_type="widget" data-id="2323ccc" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
<div class="elementor-widget-container">
<p>CURE Foundation is a non-profit organization dedicated to addressing the inequalities in access to cancer care by providing subsidized or free treatment to patients from underprivileged communities. The foundation also attempts to increase public awareness of cancer, its prevention, symptoms, early detection, treatment, and rehabilitation.</p> </div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-5f3204c elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default" data-element_type="section" data-id="5f3204c">
<div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default">
<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-761c987" data-element_type="column" data-id="761c987">
<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-dd00647 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-element_type="widget" data-id="dd00647" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
<div class="elementor-widget-container">
<p>FOUNDER</p> </div>
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-c0d0687 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-element_type="widget" data-id="c0d0687" data-widget_type="heading.default">
<div class="elementor-widget-container">
<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Do More Together Than You Can Alone
</h2> </div>
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2232567 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-element_type="widget" data-id="2232567" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
<div class="elementor-widget-container">
<p>Dr. Chitti Moorthy, MD is a radiation oncologist in Valhalla, New York. He is currently licensed to practice medicine in New York, New Jersey, and District of Columbia. He is affiliated with Westchester Medical Center and is a Professor of Radiation Oncology at New York Medical College.</p> </div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-81a4d84" data-element_type="column" data-id="81a4d84">
<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-09a07d9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-element_type="widget" data-id="09a07d9" data-widget_type="image.default">
<div class="elementor-widget-container">
<img alt="" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/assets/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/Moorthy-Chitty.jpg" title=""/> </div>
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5121204 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-element_type="widget" data-id="5121204" data-widget_type="heading.default">
<div class="elementor-widget-container">
<h4 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Late Dr. Chitti R. Moorthy, M.D.</h4> </div>
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6dcdce6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-element_type="widget" data-id="6dcdce6" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
<div class="elementor-widget-container">
<p><strong>Chairman and Professor of Clinical Radiation Medicine.</strong><br/><strong>Department of Radiation Medicine</strong></p> </div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-e4ed74a elementor-section-content-middle elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default" data-element_type="section" data-id="e4ed74a">
<div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default">
<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-ce9986f" data-element_type="column" data-id="ce9986f">
<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-b9b06f3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-element_type="widget" data-id="b9b06f3" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
<div class="elementor-widget-container">
<p>Founder</p> </div>
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-a0a5719 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-element_type="widget" data-id="a0a5719" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
<div class="elementor-widget-container">
<p>Dr. P Vijay Anand Reddy</p> </div>
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-38c1ddd elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-element_type="widget" data-id="38c1ddd" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
<div class="elementor-widget-container">
<p>The two met when Dr. Vijay Anand Reddy earned a fellowship in New York Medical College in the 90s – when Dr. Chitti Moorthy was the more experienced professor and mentor. During this fellowship, they developed a deep bond from the ground-breaking research work that they achieved together. A bond resulting from mutual appreciation of superlative technical skills and an overlapping set of core values.</p> </div>
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2c03f68 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-element_type="widget" data-id="2c03f68" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
<div class="elementor-widget-container">
<p><strong>Director &amp; Senior Consultant</strong><br/><strong>Apollo Cancer Hospital Hyderabad</strong></p> </div>
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-faf1bf0 e-grid-align-left elementor-shape-rounded elementor-grid-0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-social-icons" data-element_type="widget" data-id="faf1bf0" data-widget_type="social-icons.default">
