</div>
<section class="elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-59d3e4a elementor-section-full_width elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default" data-element_type="section" data-id="59d3e4a" data-settings='{"background_background":"classic"}'>
<div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-no">
<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-fe1ba39" data-element_type="column" data-id="fe1ba39">
<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-16b2279 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-element_type="widget" data-id="16b2279" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
<div class="elementor-widget-container">
<p>CURE Foundation is a manifestation of their core values. The foundation has been thriving since its inception through extensive collaborative and progressive initiatives. The partnership between these world-renowned cancer specialists, enhanced by the support from their globally recognized institutes, became a powerful force of impact through exchange of knowledge and resources between India and the US.</p> </div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-df666d6 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default" data-element_type="section" data-id="df666d6">
<div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default">
<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-dc33ae9" data-element_type="column" data-id="dc33ae9">
<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-163397a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-element_type="widget" data-id="163397a" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
